            This is a two chord song, base of C with switches to F.  It can be played with traditional chord fingerings.

However, another effective way of performing it that makes improvising easy is to use an alternate tuning.

Tune the guitar for open strings from low E to high E as follows:

[E] [C] [E] [G] [C] [E]

This gives you the C chord without using your fingers.  The barre the fifth fret and you have the alternate F chord.  Simple as that.

